      "bullets": [
        "Domain experts extract significantly higher utility from frontier models like Claude 3.5 Sonnet through precise prompt framing and hallucination detection.",
        "Senior engineers use LLMs to accelerate complex refactoring and architecture, whereas non-experts struggle to validate subtle code flaws.",
        "Maximizing AI productivity requires expert-led prompt engineering, domain-specific evaluation benchmarks, and strict human-in-the-loop verification."
